1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,824
This is my grandma
这是我奶奶

2
00:00:00,825 --> 00:00:02,263
my grandma is very beautiful
我奶奶很漂亮

3
00:00:02,265 --> 00:00:04,113
She makes delicious food for me
她给我做好吃的

4
00:00:04,264 --> 00:00:05,753
We like to bake cookies together
我们喜欢一起烤饼干

5
00:00:06,025 --> 00:00:08,833
Grandma tells me stories and teaches me how to garden
奶奶给我讲故事教我园艺

6
00:00:09,064 --> 00:00:11,784
We plant flowers and vegetables in the yard
我们在院子里种花种菜

7
00:00:11,785 --> 00:00:14,474
She is very patient and combs my hair
她很有耐心给我梳头

8
00:00:14,664 --> 00:00:16,434
I Love my grandma very much
我很爱我的奶奶

